            "relevance_eFtfkY": "- **Relevance Score:** 75/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Highly Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses autoethnography to detail guard\u2011inmate relations, officer emotions, and prison conditions; mentions policy shifts and occasional rights concerns, but lacks violence data or rehab focus.",
            "abstract_mEOOqY": "Objetivo deste artigo \u00e9 discutir as rela\u00e7\u00f5es e emo\u00e7\u00f5es cotidianas implicadas no trabalho da seguran\u00e7a prisional. A discuss\u00e3o est\u00e1 pautada em uma narrativa autoetnogr\u00e1fica produzida a partir da atua\u00e7\u00e3o dos autores como policiais penais e pesquisadores em cadeias p\u00fablicas e penitenci\u00e1rias do sistema prisional cearense ao longo da \u00faltima d\u00e9cada. O texto foca nas rela\u00e7\u00f5es e emo\u00e7\u00f5es constitu\u00eddas no cotidiano carcer\u00e1rio que est\u00e3o diretamente conectadas \u00e0s condi\u00e7\u00f5es das pris\u00f5es, aos processos de trabalho e as suas interfer\u00eancias na vida dos profissionais. As transforma\u00e7\u00f5es na pol\u00edtica prisional, em diferentes momentos e contextos, contornam n\u00e3o apenas as rela\u00e7\u00f5es constitu\u00eddas entre prisioneiros e profissionais, mas a pr\u00f3pria din\u00e2mica de trabalho dos policiais penais cearenses.",
            "gang-dynamics_Y8XYpP": "The provided metadata does not contain information about prison gang dynamics, structures, or affiliations, including gang organization, membership patterns, violence, inter-gang dynamics, influence on prison operations, or security threat groups. The article focuses on the daily relationships and emotions involved in prison security work, the conditions of prisons, work processes, and their impact on professionals' lives within the Cear\u00e1 prison system.",
            "prison-life-a_IPKKQX": "The article discusses the daily relations and emotions involved in prison security work, focusing on how these are connected to the conditions of prisons, work processes, and their impact on professionals' lives. It also mentions that transformations in prison policy affect relations between prisoners and professionals, as well as the work dynamics of Cear\u00e1's prison police. The text does not detail daily routines, living conditions, inmate experiences, quality of life factors, prison culture, social dynamics among inmates, programs, activities, or challenges specifically from the inmates' perspective.",
            "prison-condit_y7RVPo": "The article discusses daily relationships and emotions involved in prison security work, focusing on conditions, work processes, and their impact on professionals' lives. It mentions relations and emotions constituted in the carceral daily life, directly connected to prison conditions and work processes. The text highlights how transformations in prison policy affect the dynamics of work for Cear\u00e1's penal police officers.",
            "violence-and_Td4kKP": "Not available in metadata.",
            "staff-prisone_8CiEa7": "The article discusses the daily relationships and emotions involved in prison security work, focusing on those constituted in the carceral daily life. These dynamics are connected to prison conditions, work processes, and their impact on professionals' lives. Transformations in prison policy influence not only the relationships between prisoners and professionals but also the work dynamics of Cear\u00e1's penal police.",
