            "prison-life-a_IPKKQX": "The paper's title, \"Prison Culture, Management, and In-Prison Violence,\" indicates a focus on prison culture. The full text mentions academic attention to violence and other forms of in-prison misconduct, noting that most research uses stale perspectives and a broader framework is needed. Topics include prison violence, prison, and misconduct. The abstract highlights a need for a broader framework for in-prison violence and misconduct within the criminal justice system.",
