                    "PHYSICAL VIOLENCE"
                ],
                "rank": 8,
                "relevance_data": {},
                "source": "scispace_full_text",
                "relevance_summary": "Uses inmate\u2011staff sexual and physical violence narratives to illustrate power imbalances; describes housing units, showers, and yard spots where fights occur; provides rich qualitative accounts of assaults but lacks systematic statistics; does not address officer mental health; highlights abuse and rights violations through staff\u2011perpetrated assaults; omits programmatic, legal, or comparative analyses.",
                "relevance_metadata": {
