                "tldr": "Understanding prison living: Mitigating incompatible incarcerated people through the perspectives of correctional officers TLDR - In-depth interviews with COs reveal the complex prison hierarchy and its impact on managing and perceiving incompatible incarcerated people. Spatial designs and protocols contribute to or mitigate incompatibility. Architectural transformation and policy reforms are needed to effectively manage this issue.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
