                "source": "scispace_full_text",
                "relevance_summary": "Uses inmate\u2011staff interview data to detail supportive vs abusive guard interactions and sexual assault cases, providing qualitative conflict counts; mentions limited prison routine details; lacks officer stress, rehab programs, policy analysis, or cross\u2011system comparisons.",
