            "relevance_eFtfkY": "- **Relevance Score:** 42/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses inmate narratives to illustrate daily frustrations, fear, and violence, touching on officer\u2011inmate relations and deprivations, but lacks quantitative data, guard stress analysis, or policy discussion.",
