                "tldr": "This article analyzed a sample of 694 official reports of assaultive incidents in a large state prison system over a one-year period and found that assaultive events occur in relation to a number of interactional themes such as, officer's command, protest, search, inmates' fighting, movement, contraband, restraint, discipline, emotional instability, sexual, intoxication, and medical.",
