            "relevance_eFtfkY": "- **Relevance Score:** 33/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses comprehensive quality-of-life framework to assess security, order, and relational dimensions of prison life, providing detailed insight into environmental conditions but limited on interaction specifics, violence data, officer stress, rights violations, rehabilitation, policy analysis, or comparative history.",
