                "tldr": "In this paper, a partir desses dados, comparamos as redes pessoais dos agentes penitenciarios com as dos presos, and utilizamos os seus discursos sobre padroes de interacao, dentro e fora da prisao, for entendimento das configuracoes assumidas.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
                "rank": 28,
                "relevance_data": {},
                "source": "scispace",
                "relevance_summary": "Uses sociometric interviews to compare personal networks of guards and inmates, revealing guards' more prison\u2011bound ties; lacks detail on environment, violence, stress, rights, programs, policy, or broader comparisons.",
                "relevance_metadata": {
                    "criteria_judgments": [
                        {
                            "criterion_name": "Prisoner\u2011Guard Interaction Dynamics",
                            "relevance": "Somewhat Relevant"
                        },
                        {
                            "criterion_name": "Prison Environment and Living Conditions",
