                        "total": null
                    }
                },
                "tldr": "In this paper, the authors examined the relationship between inmates and their communities in California's male prison institutions, focusing on the non-violent, non-criminal relations of inmates and identifying the effects of both the institutional structural setting and informal social organization.",
