                "id": 2803716556,
                "full_slug": "being-on-point-exploring-the-stress-related-experiences-of-6qtgu8l31a",
                "title": "Being \u201con point\u201d: Exploring the stress-related experiences of incarceration",
                "abstract": "Prior studies establish a link between incarceration and stress-related health, but relatively little is known about perceived stressors among current and former prisoners. To better understand the...",
                "is_archived": false,
                "publication_type": "Journal Article",
                "doi": "10.1177/2156869318771439",
